{"id":"We33a307420e0e160f54be342","zh":"逆傅里叶变换","en":"","name":"逆傅里叶变换","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"We33a307420e0e160f54be342","text":"逆傅里叶变换","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sfbed0e09e146b9e4c140","source_id":"P108","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"通过统计、归纳武广高速铁路2013 年近9 月的轨道高低不平顺谱,采用逆傅里叶变换方法[22],反演获得轨道高低随机不平顺,波长范围为1~60 m,可作为中波和长波不平顺激励源,见图7。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"Sd49877130c32dd20aa9f","source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"若以月为监测的时间单位,假定第i月此线路区段轨道随机不平顺谱在累计上、下限概率分别为Ci,u和 Ci,d的累计概率谱内波动;同时,用τi→k,u、 τi→k,d表示从第i月到第k月的上、下限谱累计概率变化率,一般存在等式 Ck,u|d=Ci,u|d(1±τi→k,u|d) (1) (3)根据(2)中确定的线路不平顺谱线累计概率范围,采用拉丁超立方抽样(LHS)方法 [6]进行此累计概率范围内轨道谱的抽样,对采集的轨道谱进行逆傅里叶变换 [3],生成随机轨道不平顺时域样本。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S9dfdfd04bafa79ba3af0","source_id":"P115","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"(4)将得到的复序列X(Δs)进行逆傅里叶变换可获得轨道随机不平顺模拟信号。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P017":{"id":"P017","title":"A spectral evolution model for track geometric degradation in train–track long-term dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2020","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1564834","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics","label":"Xu等（2020）","overview_slug":"2020-a-spectral-evolution-model-for-track-geometric-degradation-in-train-track-long-term-dynamics"},"P108":{"id":"P108","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","authors":"贺天龙,陈宪麦,徐磊","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672−7207.2017.08.023","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"贺天龙等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness"},"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演